  "content": "\n\n# GregTech PBR\n這是給 [GregTech CE: Unofficial](https://modrinth.com/mod/gregtech-ce-unofficial) 使用的 PBR 材質包。<br/>\n此材質包需搭配支援 LabPBR 協議的光影使用。<br/>\n若想在不使用光影的情況下體驗 3D／深度效果，請下載檔名帶有「No_Shaders」後綴的版本。<br/>\n共收錄 483 張視差貼圖；總計 3896 張貼圖。\n# 圖庫\nSEUS PTGI GFME 光影\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2d0c7f5-85c6-4600-b22e-914099f63720\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc61d45a-ab9e-4629-9d2e-bcfa41a8037a\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7f46f58-4f4a-4f06-96df-dc8ac924e658\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd54a34a-4504-43ee-8de7-f2319bb2d1a3\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb9e1d53-2d0c-4033-a30a-3338cd5398eb\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/155c928f-0b70-46dd-b3e6-06f90c82c4c6\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c66fd4cc-2aee-4ae2-b778-4dee113e4faa\" />",
